    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**A live, OpenTelemetry-instrumented cross-venue prediction-market trading system** (Kalshi + Polymarket US, Go). This board reads top-to-bottom like the interview walkthrough: **Reliability \u2192 Latency \u2192 The Edge \u2192 Execution.** Every series is live from the always-on recorder \u2014 no real money is at risk. The *honest* headline is in **The Edge**: at retail depth the cross-venue gap almost never clears the ~3.49\u00a2 fee wall, and this system proves it with data instead of losing money finding out."
      }
    },
